/
/
/CONTAINS REVISIONS OF FP FORMAT TO BE
/COMPATABLE WITH FOCAL AND CURRENT SFPP.
/HFPP FP NUMBER FORMAT AS FOLLOWS:
/   EXPONENT - INTERNALLY FOR HFPP IN
/              2S COMP FORM, I.E. FAC IS               ALWAYS IN 2S COMP.
